Package: etlspatial
Title: Reproducible Spatial ETL Workflows for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Robert", "Andronaco", email = "data@georiskanalysis.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for robust, repeatable, and scalable spatial ETL workflows. Supports reading, writing, validation, quality assurance, and movement of spatial data between sf objects, DuckDB, Parquet, qs2, file geodatabases, GeoPackages, and shapefiles while maintaining geometry integrity and reproducible processing workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://georiskanalysis.com, https://georiskexplorer.github.io/etlspatial/, https://github.com/GeoRiskExplorer/etlspatial
